# vanguard/data/ is a symlink into C:\Users\ACKVerissimo\vanguard\data\ — an
# external, non-repo directory holding the live actuarial database (~725MB)
# plus ~14GB of historical snapshots. git does not treat it as an opaque
# symlink here; `git add -n vanguard/data` walks into it and would stage
# hundreds of MB–GB of parquet/json. Exclude explicitly. See backup note.
vanguard/data/

# vanguard/trades/ — live trade/governance JSON records (real trading
# history, not pipeline output in the disposable sense, but also not code
# or documentation). Excluded from this code-and-docs snapshot; flagged
# separately for the operator rather than committed by default.
vanguard/trades/

